  "question": {
    "text": "The reaction sequence given below is carried out with 16 moles of $\\mathbf{X}$. The yield of the major product in each step is given below the product in parentheses. The amount (in grams) of $\\mathbf{S}$ produced is ______ .\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/azwCMD7LImwx17HShr9t6FkTvUhpI5OUuKU0lz_ZdMY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>$\\text { Use: Atomic mass (in amu): } \\mathrm{H}=1, \\mathrm{C}=12, \\mathrm{O}=16, \\mathrm{Br}=80$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "175",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/831mc7qyQEwm0uGfoG22AVViV6QQHh1jSUtdZz6UJck.original.fullsize.png\"><br>$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{M}=\\left(\\mathrm{C}_6 \\mathrm{H}_4\\right)_2\\left(\\mathrm{C}_6 \\mathrm{H}_5\\right)_2 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\mathrm{H}_4 \\mathrm{O} \\\\\n& =350\n\\end{aligned}$\nWeight of product of $S=350 \\times 1 / 2=175 \\mathrm{gm}$ Ans.\n* WES : Williamson ether synthesis",
    "image": null
  },
